<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ENDESA.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on ENDESA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International has issued 750,000 American-style call warrants on Empresa Nacional de Electricidad SA, lead manager Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    8285 PTA		  PREMIUM	11.71 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     820 PTA		   GEARING	9.93 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	12.NOV.97		 PAYDATE	03.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  8150 PTA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
